---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   ->  Index Only Scan using pg_class_relname_nsp_index on pg_class
         Index Cond: (relname = ANY ('{tc_t,tc_t_pkey,pg_class}'::name[]))
 Optimizer: Postgres-based planner
